@startuml gateway_sequence
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam defaultFontSize 13

actor "Client\n(QuicGateway)" as C
box "DMZ" #LightBlue
  participant "Gateway Server" as GW
end box
box "Private Network" #LightGreen
  participant "Login Service" as LS
  participant "Lobby Service" as LBS
  participant "World Server" as WS
end box

== 1. Connection & Authentication Phase ==
C -> GW: Connect (QUIC/TLS 1.3)
activate GW
GW -> GW: Initialize Connection State:\n**STATE = UNAUTHENTICATED**

C -> GW: GatewayFrame(flag=FLAG_LOGIN, payload=LoginRequest)
note over GW: Gateway enforces **UNAUTHENTICATED** state:\nForce routes all traffic to Login Service
GW -> LS: GatewayFrame(flag=FLAG_LOGIN, payload=LoginRequest)
activate LS
LS -> LS: Authenticate Account
LS --> GW: GatewayFrame(flag=FLAG_LOGIN, metadata="status=auth_success", payload=LoginResponse)
deactivate LS

note over GW: Gateway intercepts **status=auth_success**:\nTransitions **STATE = AUTHENTICATED**
GW --> C: GatewayFrame(flag=FLAG_LOGIN, metadata="status=auth_success", payload=LoginResponse)

== 2. Character Selection Phase ==
C -> GW: GatewayFrame(flag=FLAG_LOBBY, payload=CharListRequest)
note over GW: Gateway enforces **AUTHENTICATED** state:\nAllows FLAG_LOGIN or FLAG_LOBBY routing
GW -> LBS: GatewayFrame(flag=FLAG_LOBBY, payload=CharListRequest)
activate LBS
LBS --> GW: GatewayFrame(flag=FLAG_LOBBY, payload=CharListResponse)
deactivate LBS
GW --> C: GatewayFrame(flag=FLAG_LOBBY, payload=CharListResponse)

== 3. Play Redirection & World Assignment ==
C -> GW: GatewayFrame(flag=FLAG_LOBBY, payload=PlayRequest)
GW -> LBS: GatewayFrame(flag=FLAG_LOBBY, payload=PlayRequest)
activate LBS
note over LBS: Create session & assign World Server
LBS --> GW: GatewayFrame(flag=FLAG_LOBBY, metadata="status=play_success;worldAddress=localhost:35002;sessionId=xyz", payload=PlayResponse)
deactivate LBS

note over GW: Gateway intercepts **status=play_success**:\n1. Resolves/connects to World Client (localhost:35002)\n2. Binds connection to World Client\n3. Transitions **STATE = PLAYING**
GW --> C: GatewayFrame(flag=FLAG_LOBBY, metadata="status=play_success;...", payload=PlayResponse)

== 4. Active Session (Direct World Routing) ==
C -> GW: GatewayFrame(flag=FLAG_WORLD, payload=PingRequest)
note over GW: Gateway enforces **PLAYING** state:\nRoutes FLAG_WORLD directly to bound World Client
GW -> WS: GatewayFrame(flag=FLAG_WORLD, payload=PingRequest)
activate WS
WS --> GW: GatewayFrame(flag=FLAG_WORLD, payload=PingResponse)
deactivate WS
GW --> C: GatewayFrame(flag=FLAG_WORLD, payload=PingResponse)

@enduml
